        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I am afraid there is indeed no good (concise and efficient) way of having virtual lines of overlay show syntax highlight. The reasoning is basically [this comment](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/issues/1847#issuecomment-2952787808). Although it would be cool and I am open to adding something like this if upstream Neovim adds something to make it work (although I don't even know what that might even be).\n\nClosing as \"not planned until there are better built-in tools or a way to add virtual lines\".",
